           quic_n=0 quic_ttft_p50_ms=null quic_itl_p50_ms=null quic_itl_p95_ms=null
           fallback_n=3 fallback_protocols=h2 comparable=false
AB_END status=no_h3_negotiated

  → A 组 protocol∈{h2} 全成功、gaps=0、300 events、itl_p50≈10ms（与 burst
